      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i think i also need to address the specific legal precedence. the Valerius archives suggest that under the 1848 treaty, sovereign rights in kind aren't lost even if the territory is absorbed. can you help me find some language that uses that specific legal angle so they know i'm not just some person making things up, but that i actually understand the international law that supports my claim? maybe something about the continuity of the crown?",
